{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"57900","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57900","key":"SV-11406","fields":{"summary":"Tech View: the next group header pushes the held header off while scrolling","parent":{"id":"56387","key":"SV-10043","self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/56387","fields":{"summary":"Work Orders — Board View & Tech View Display Options","status":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/status/10004","description":"This work item is being actively worked on at the moment by the assignee.","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/","name":"In Progress","id":"10004","statusCategory":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/statuscategory/4","id":4,"key":"indeterminate","colorName":"yellow","name":"In Progress"}},"priority":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/priority/3","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/images/icons/priorities/medium_new.svg","name":"Medium","id":"3"},"issuetype":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issuetype/10006","id":"10006","description":"Epics track collections of related bugs, stories, and tasks. (Migrated on 31 Dec 2023 09:01 UTC)","iconUrl":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10306?size=medium","name":"Epic","subtask":false,"avatarId":10306,"entityId":"b16adb77-4b77-44c6-9be7-926745903790","hierarchyLevel":1}}},"attachment":[],"description":"h3. What\n\nWhile scrolling, the held group header is pushed off by the next group's header instead of swapping in place.\n\nh3. Expected\n\nS2-E1: \"While the user scrolls through an expanded group, that group's header stays on screen just under the column headings. Only one group header is held at a time: when the next group's header reaches it, the next header pushes it off and takes its place. Unassigned's header works the same way (S2-R18).\"\n\nPRD: [Board View & Tech View PRD v55|https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=845185030] (S2-E1, S2-R18).\n\nh3. Actual (origin/develop, 2026-10-15)\n\nFrom the code on develop: a single held header shows the group of the first row on screen and swaps in place; the next group's header slides underneath it until its first row reaches the top, then the held header changes. Please confirm on staging while fixing.\n\nh3. How to check\n\n* With two or more groups expanded, scroll down: the next group's header pushes the held one up and off, then is held itself.\n* Scrolling back up reverses it.\n* Unassigned behaves the same way.\n* Only one header is held at any time.\n\nFrom the PRD v54/v55 rulings on Bilal's and Slavcho's questions, 2026-10-15.","reporter":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3Aaa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","accountId":"712020:aa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png"},"displayName":"Chris Ward","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Bogota","accountType":"atlassian"},"comment":{"comments":[{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57900/comment/78808","id":"78808","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3Aaa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","accoun